  "notableFeatures": [
    "Bilingual EN/ES toggle",
    "Pinned, scroll-driven photo hero with a four-column fact bar (address, CLIA lab ID, team, languages)",
    "Mission statement that lights up word by word on scroll",
    "Animated canvas background (\"silk\" and gold threads) in the laboratory section",
