  ],
  "designNotes": "A warm, hospitality-grade take on a clinical-research site: ivory (#f6f1e7) and espresso (#1f1712) with champagne and gold (#b08a3e) accents, and gold-gradient pill buttons. Headlines are set in Cormorant Garamond Light with italic flourishes (\"South Miami\"), paired with Hanken Grotesk for body copy and tracked uppercase labels. The hero is a full-bleed, darkened photo of the clinic reception with its gold SM monogram, pinned while you scroll, above a four-column fact bar. Below, a statement lights up word by word, a four-row index routes patients, sponsors, team and visitors, and the lab section sits on an espresso panel with an animated silk-and-gold-thread canvas behind its stats.",
  "businessSummary": "South Miami Medical & Research Group runs clinical studies with pharmaceutical companies at 7400 SW 50th Terrace, Suite 201, in South Miami, with physicians, nurses, a research staff and an in-house CLIA-certified laboratory. The site recruits patients for studies in English and Spanish and pitches the site to sponsors and CROs.",
